  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'the fresh prince' because the meme uses this text to directly label and stereotype Meghan Markle, implying the user is seeing or interpreting the meme through the lens of this derogatory label. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the image, but the projection occurs implicitly through the user's engagement with the text overlay, which functions as a direct address to the viewer's understanding of the subject (Meghan Markle).",
